scroll of genocide.

Got it.

One wish left. I wished for a blessed scroll of charging.

Got that too.

So now I charged the wand.

a wand of wishing (3)

Now I have three wishes. Okay. I'm taking the Nestea plunge and
heading into Gennhomm, so I better make this count.

