It worked. Betty didn't mind.

Then I put on the ring of Conflict. BIG MISTAKE!

Right away, Betty started fighting me, then a POSSE of nasties came
from nowhere.

"You are blinded by Betty's radience."
"Betty hits. Betty hits. Betty kicks."

Oh SHIT! It WASN'T A BLESSED FIGURINE!

Wrong. I looked at Betty and it said "Tame Archon called Betty".

Then, going over the game after I lost in two rounds, BTW, Betty
summoned an Aleax to help her, and together those two, along with the
OTHER meanies, finished me off at a whopping -59/119 HP's.

I figured out what went awry in my plan. The ring.

I should have EITHER had the ring OR the Figurine, but not both.

Let this be a lesson to you, kids.

